// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

#define BASE 0
#define NAV  1
#define SYM  2
#define ADJ  3

&mt {
    quick-tap-ms = <100>;
    global-quick-tap;
    flavor = "tap-preferred";
    tapping-term-ms = <170>;
};

/ {
    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        combo_esc {
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            key-positions = <0 1>;
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
        };

        combo_enter {
            bindings = <&kp ENTER>;
            key-positions = <16 17>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_greater {
            bindings = <&kp GREATER_THAN>;
            key-positions = <10 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_question {
            bindings = <&kp QUESTION>;
            key-positions = <21 16>;
            layers = <2>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_hash {
            bindings = <&kp HASH>;
            key-positions = <22 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_percent {
            bindings = <&kp PERCENT>;
            key-positions = <23 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_ampersand {
            bindings = <&kp AMPERSAND>;
            key-positions = <24 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_backslash {
            bindings = <&kp NON_US_BACKSLASH>;
            key-positions = <25 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_grave {
            bindings = <&kp GRAVE>;
            key-positions = <4 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_apostrophe {
            bindings = <&kp APOS>;
            key-positions = <14 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_win {
            bindings = <&sk LEFT_WIN>;
            key-positions = <12 13>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
        };

        combo_underscore {
            bindings = <&kp UNDERSCORE>;
            key-positions = <19 16>;
            timeout-ms = <50>;
            layers = <2>;
        };

        combo_alt {
            bindings = <&sk LEFT_ALT>;
            key-positions = <2 3>;
        };
    };

    macros {
        // ---- lowercase ----
        // ---- uppercase ----
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        // ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

        base_layer {
            label = "BASE";
            bindings = <
             &kp Q  &kp W  &kp E      &kp R           &kp T    &kp Y  &kp U      &kp I          &kp O    &kp P
             &kp A  &kp S  &kp D      &kp F           &kp G    &kp H  &kp J      &kp K          &kp L    &kp APOSTROPHE
&key_repeat  &kp Z  &kp X  &kp C      &kp V           &kp B    &kp N  &kp M      &kp COMMA      &kp DOT  &kp FSLH        &kp DEL
                           &sk LCTRL  &sk LEFT_SHIFT  &to 2    &to 1  &kp SPACE  &kp BACKSPACE
            >;
        };

        // ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

        nav_layer {
            label = "NAVI";
            bindings = <
        &msc SCRL_UP    &bt BT_CLR      &mkp LCLK     &mkp MCLK       &mkp RCLK          &kp HOME      &kp PG_DN   &kp PG_UP        &kp END              &kp INS
        &msc SCRL_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_UP  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT    &kp LEFT      &kp DOWN    &kp UP           &kp RIGHT            &kp CAPSLOCK
&trans  &none           &none           &none         &none           &none              &kp LC(LEFT)  &kp C_MENU  &kp PRINTSCREEN  &kp LC(RIGHT_ARROW)  &none         &trans
                                        &trans        &mo 3           &to 0              &to 2         &trans      &trans
            >;
        };

        // ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

        num_sim_layer {
            label = "NUM_SYM";
            bindings = <
        &kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp LEFT_BRACE        &kp RIGHT_BRACE        &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &kp TILDE            &kp KP_DIVIDE  &kp KP_N7  &kp KP_N8  &kp KP_N9  &kp KP_ASTERISK
        &kp LESS_THAN     &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp EQUAL          &kp DOUBLE_QUOTES    &kp KP_PLUS    &kp KP_N4  &kp KP_N5  &kp KP_N6  &kp MINUS
&trans  &kp EXCLAMATION   &kp AT_SIGN           &kp DOLLAR             &kp CARET          &kp PIPE             &kp KP_N0      &kp KP_N1  &kp KP_N2  &kp KP_N3  &kp COMMA        &kp KP_DOT
                                                &trans                 &mo 3              &to 0                &to 1          &trans     &trans
            >;
        };

        // ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

        adjust_layer {
            label = "ADJ";
            bindings = <
        &kp C_MUTE  &kp C_VOL_DN  &kp C_VOLUME_UP  &kp C_BRI_DEC  &kp C_BRI_UP    &bt BT_CLR  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &kp F12
        &kp C_PREV  &kp C_NEXT    &none            &none          &none           &bt BT_NXT  &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &kp F11
&trans  &none       &none         &none            &none          &none           &bt BT_PRV  &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F10  &trans
                                  &trans           &none          &none           &none       &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };
};
